{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LaCpEq11nvevdwXF9zx9Rs","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2024 2025 acceptance rate robotics learning conference\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"USC at the Conference of Robot Learning (CoRL) 2024 - USC Viterbi | School of Engineering\",\"url\":\"https://viterbischool.usc.edu/news/2024/11/usc-at-the-conference-of-robot-learning-corl-2024/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate: Statistics of acceptance rate for the main robotics conference · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025\",\"url\":\"https://2025.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"Robot Learning Foundation\",\"url\":\"https://www.robot-learning.org/\"},{\"title\":\"Conference on Robot Learning (@corl_conf) · X\",\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/corl_conf\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about CoRL acceptance rates:\n\n**CoRL 2024:** The conference's oral track had an acceptance rate of only 6.6%. CoRL 2024 received 671 submissions.\n\n**CoRL 2025:** The search results indicate that CoRL 2025 was held in Seoul, Korea, and was co-located with Humanoids 2025. However, I was unable to find specific overall acceptance rate statistics for CoRL 2025 in the search results.\n\nThe information about the overall acceptance rate for CoRL 2024 (not just the oral track) and specific figures for CoRL 2025 were not av