{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YJd4uTobKqUjstSH6sbY3Q","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Exit collapse + routing gradient 保持为 core findings（reviewer acceptance\n2\t  ~75%）， CF sensitivity 降为 \"supporting evidence with caveats\"（acceptance ~45%）。 1-2\n3\t  位 reviewer 指出 metric incomparability（trained Cohen''s d vs untrained cosine dist）\n4\t  使 amplification 的定量化不可靠，要求 behavioral validation 作为 representational claims 的补充。\n5\t  Rebuttal 需要：(1) Δ>0.10 阈值 sensitivity analysis，(2) 诚实回应 behavioral gap， (3) 将 CF\n6\t  从 \"core finding\" 重新定位为 \"consistent observation\"。 预计 reviewer_avg ~6.0，accept_prob\n7\t  ~0.35，rebuttal_success ~0.50。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: SigLIP+Projector RSA baseline\n12\t  plan_id: plan_001\n13\t  description: SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO — 证明 action-relevant 结构源自\n14\t    frozen vision encoder\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    siglip_projector_rsa: 0.6153\n17\t    bootstrap_95_ci:\n18\t    - 0.5257\n19\t    - 0.6954\n20\t    trained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.4876\n21\t    untrained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.4846\n22\t    dino_rsa: 0.388\n23\t    llm_degradation_magnitude: 0.127\n24\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下此实验被全部 reviewer 接受（A1 holds）。RSA=0.615 >> VLA 0.488\n25\t    的 gap 清晰建立了 \"vision encoder 是 action-relevant structure 的主要来源\" 这一非争议性结论。 但 1 位\n26\t    reviewer 会注意到这是 RSA metric 下的结论——CKA 下 ordering 不同（plan_009 结果）。 此实验对 C1 framework\n27\t    贡献最大，不涉及 median 档位的核心争议点（CF metric incomparability）。 CI 较宽 [0.526, 0.695] 会被提及但不作为\n28\t    major concern，因为 point estimate 远高于 VLA peak。\n29\t\n30\t    '\n31\t  tables:\n32\t  - title: Action-Relevant Structure Source Decomposition\n33\t    columns:\n34\t    - Representation\n35\t    - RSA (ρ)\n36\t    - 95% CI\n37\t    - vs DINO\n38\t    rows:\n39\t    - - SigLIP+Projector\n40\t      - '0.615'\n41\t      - '[0.526, 0.695]'\n42\t      - '+0.227'\n43\t    - - VLA Trained Peak (L9)\n44\t      - '0.488'\n45\t      - —\n46\t      - '+0.100'\n47\t    - - VLA Untrained Peak (L12)\n48\t      - '0.485'\n49\t      - —\n50\t      - '+0.097'\n51\t    - - DINO cls_token\n52\t      - '0.388'\n53\t      - —\n54\t      - baseline\n55\t  figures_description:\n56\t  - 'Bar chart: RSA values for SigLIP projector > VLA trained ≈ VLA untrained >> DINO,\n57\t    with 95% CI error bars。清晰的三级阶梯。'\n58\t  analysis: 'Reviewer 共识：frozen encoder dominance 不争议。但 median 档位下 Reviewer 2 可能指出\n59\t    \"LLM degradation\" 的措辞过强——LLM 同时在做 instruction routing 和 action computation， RSA\n60\t    下降可能反映功能转换而非信息丢失。建议用 \"geometric reorganization\" 替代 \"degradation\"。 此实验在 rebuttal\n61\t    中无需调整。\n62\t\n63\t    '\n64\t- name: DINO standalone baseline\n65\t  plan_id: plan_002\n66\t  description: DINOv2 baseline RSA — standalone vision model 参照\n67\t  expected_results:\n68\t    temporal_distance_rho_pooled: 0.833\n69\t    per_task_rho_mean: 0.9008\n70\t    R2: 0.687\n71\t    subtask_macro_auc: 0.9717\n72\t    control_b_permutation_rho: 0.039\n73\t  result_rationale: 'Clean baseline，无争议。DINO RSA=0.388 远低于 VLA 和 projector，建立了 architecture\n74\t    gap。 Subtask AUC=0.97 被 reviewer 接受但会引发 \"goals are visually distinguishable\" 的注意，\n75\t    这在后续 goal classification experiments 中成为 confound（10-way classification trivially\n76\t    easy）。 Median 档位下此实验本身不受挑战，但 reviewer 会用它来质疑后续 probe 实验的 discriminability。\n77\t\n78\t    '\n79\t  tables:\n80\t  - title: DINOv2 Standalone Performance\n81\t    columns:\n82\t    - Metric\n83\t    - Value\n84\t    - Note\n85\t    rows:\n86\t    - - Temporal ρ (per-task)\n87\t      - '0.901'\n88\t      - correct baseline\n89\t    - - Action Probe R²\n90\t      - '0.687'\n91\t      - vision-only ceiling\n92\t    - - Subtask AUC\n93\t      - '0.972'\n94\t      - visually distinguishable\n95\t    - - Permutation Control ρ\n96\t      - '0.039'\n97\t      - validates signal\n98\t  figures_description:\n99\t  - 'Scatter: predicted vs actual temporal distance，per-task colored。High correlation\n100\t    but cross-task variance visible。'\n101\t  analysis: '所有 reviewer 接受。用于建立 DINO < SigLIP < VLA trained 的 ordering baseline。\n102\t    Median 档位下唯一风险：Reviewer 3 可能质疑 DINOv2 作为 baseline 的 fairness （DINOv2 是 ViT-L/14\n103\t    1024d vs VLA 4096d），但 dimension mismatch 在 RSA/CKA 中 不是 confound（metric 对 dimensionality\n104\t    invariant）。\n105\t\n106\t    '\n107\t- name: Per-layer RSA degradation curve\n108\t  plan_id: plan_003\n109\t  description: Per-layer RSA curve — 追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的变换轨迹\n110\t  expected_results:\n111\t    trained_image_mean_peak_layer: 9\n112\t    trained_image_mean_peak_rsa: 0.4876\n113\t    untrained_image_mean_peak_layer: 12\n114\t    untrained_image_mean_peak_rsa: 0.4846\n115\t    proj_to_l1_drop_trained: 0.2036\n116\t    proj_to_l1_drop_untrained: 0.1512\n117\t    trained_pattern: non_monotonic (inverted-U)\n118\t    untrained_pattern: non_monotonic\n119\t  result_rationale: 'Inverted-U pattern 是 C3 的核心 evidence。Median 档位下（A3 fails 的延伸）：\n120\t    (1) rise phase Δρ=+0.016 被 1 位 reviewer 认为 negligible（CI includes 0）， inverted-U\n121\t    的 \"rise\" 部分可能只是 noise； (2) CKA 下 pattern 完全不同（monotonic），reviewer 质疑 \"non-monotonic\n122\t    refinement\"  是 metric-specific artifact； (3) decline phase Δρ=-0.206 更 robust，但\n123\t    reviewer 要求在正文（非 appendix）承认 metric dependence。 最终 C3 作为 \"qualified observation\n124\t    under RSA\" 存活，但不贡献于 core claims。\n125\t\n126\t    '\n127\t  tables:\n128\t  - title: Per-Layer RSA Profile Summary\n129\t    columns:\n130\t    - Condition\n131\t    - Peak Layer\n132\t    - Peak RSA\n133\t    - Proj→L1 Drop\n134\t    - Pattern\n135\t    rows:\n136\t    - - Trained (with inst)\n137\t      - L9\n138\t      - '0.488'\n139\t      - '-0.204'\n140\t      - inverted-U\n141\t    - - Untrained (with inst)\n142\t      - L12\n143\t      - '0.485'\n144\t      - '-0.151'\n145\t      - non-monotonic\n146\t    - - Trained (no inst)\n147\t      - L30\n148\t      - '0.489'\n149\t      - '-0.253'\n150\t      - increasing\n151\t    - - Untrained (no inst)\n152\t      - L6\n153\t      - '0.480'\n154\t      - '-0.137'\n155\t      - non-monotonic\n156\t  figures_description:\n157\t  - '33-layer RSA profile plot: 4 conditions overlaid。Trained shows inverted-U with\n158\t    peak at L9-L12, untrained flatter。Projector output (0.615) as horizontal dashed\n159\t    line shows all LLM layers below projector。'\n160\t  analysis: 'Median 档位 Reviewer 2 的典型批评：\"The inverted-U pattern is only demonstrated\n161\t    under RSA.  CKA shows monotonic increase (plan_009), which directly contradicts\n162\t    the ''non-monotonic refinement''  narrative. The authors should either demonstrate\n163\t    metric-robustness or downgrade this to an observation.\" Response：承认并降级为 observation。Rebuttal\n164\t    可补充 R² functional probe 也显示 inverted-U （plan_011），但 reviewer 可能 counter：\"R² measures\n165\t    decodability, not geometry — different construct。\"\n166\t\n167\t    '\n168\t- name: Output head analysis (frozen encoder verification)\n169\t  plan_id: plan_004\n170\t  description: SigLIP+projector frozen 确认, LLM 权重变化不传导到视觉表征\n171\t  expected_results:\n172\t    vision_cos_sim: 1.0\n173\t    vision_rel_change: 0.0\n174\t    projector_cos_sim: 1.001\n175\t    projector_rel_change: 0.0\n176\t    llm_mean_rel_change: 1.316\n177\t    llm_range:\n178\t    - 1.22\n179\t    - 1.37\n180\t    head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n181\t    shallow_adaptation_gate: FAIL (1.12x < 3x threshold)\n182\t  result_rationale: '此实验确认 vision backbone + projector 在 trained 和 untrained 之间完全一致（cos_sim=1.0），\n183\t    解释了为什么 RSA 在 image_mean tokens 上 trained ≈ untrained。Median 档位下被接受 （A1 holds），但\n184\t    reviewer 注意到 caveat：\"comparison is pretrained Llama vs random init,  not pre/post\n185\t    fine-tuning\"，这限制了 interpretability。LLM weights uniformly distributed （ratio=1.12x）否定了\n186\t    shallow adaptation hypothesis——head 不特殊。 此实验支持 C1 framework 的 \"frozen encoder\"\n187\t    前提，不涉及 median 档位的争议点。\n188\t\n189\t    '\n190\t  tables:\n191\t  - title: Weight Divergence by Module Group\n192\t    columns:\n193\t    - Module\n194\t    - Count\n195\t    - Mean Rel Change\n196\t    - Cos Sim\n197\t    - Verdict\n198\t    rows:\n199\t    - - Vision Backbone\n200\t      - '685'\n201\t      - '0.000'\n202\t      - '1.000'\n203\t      - IDENTICAL\n204\t    - - Projector\n205\t      - '6'\n206\t      - '0.000'\n207\t      - '1.001'\n208\t      - IDENTICAL\n209\t    - - LLM Layers\n210\t      - '288'\n211\t      - '1.316'\n212\t      - '0.218'\n213\t      - DIVERGED\n214\t    - - LM Head\n215\t      - '1'\n216\t      - '1.475'\n217\t      - '0.000'\n218\t      - DIVERGED\n219\t    - - Embedding\n220\t      - '1'\n221\t      - '1.329'\n222\t      - '-0.000'\n223\t      - DIVERGED\n224\t  figures_description:\n225\t  - 'Heatmap: rel_change per LLM layer (L0-L31)，showing uniform ~1.3 across all layers，no\n226\t    depth gradient。Vision/projector rows blank (zero change)。'\n227\t  analysis: '全部 reviewer 接受。此实验为 C1 framework 提供了必要的 architectural verification。 Median\n228\t    档位下无额外挑战。但 Reviewer 1 可能在 minor comments 中建议 \"clarify that  untrained = random\n229\t    init, not ablated weights\" 以避免读者误解。\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t- name: 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks (orphaned)\n233\t  plan_id: plan_005\n234\t  description: 系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained across 6 methods\n235\t  expected_results:\n236\t    status: orphaned\n237\t    conclusion: 'All 6 methods consistent: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO'\n238\t    note: 被后续更精细的实验取代（plan_011 fulllayer R², d041 definitive RSA, etc.）\n239\t  result_rationale: '此实验在 Phase 1 被 orphaned，其核心结论（trained ≈ untrained in RSA/R²）被后续实验\n240\t    独立复现。在 median 档位下不直接贡献，但其 \"trained ≈ untrained\" 的 RSA 结论正是 reviewer 用来质疑 \"training\n241\t    effect\" narrative 的弹药之一——如果 training 不改变 RSA， 那 training 到底做了什么？Answer 在 C2（routing\n242\t    reorganization），但 reviewer 可能认为 证据不够 conclusive without behavioral validation（A4\n243\t    partially fails）。\n244\t\n245\t    '\n246\t  tables: []\n247\t  figures_description: []\n248\t  analysis: 'Orphaned，不进入论文。但其结论（trained ≈ untrained）被 plan_007 和 d041 复现， 成为 C3 \"observation\"\n249\t    而非 \"finding\" 的证据基础。\n250\t\n251\t    '\n252\t- name: Instruction ablation RSA\n253\t  plan_id: plan_006\n254\t  description: 去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\n255\t  expected_results:\n256\t    with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.4846\n257\t    no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.4802\n258\t    delta: 0.0044\n259\t    gate_threshold: 0.1\n260\t    gate_judgment: FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\n261\t  result_rationale: 'Negative result：移除 instruction 对 image token RSA 几乎无影响（Δ=0.004\n262\t    << 0.10）。 这证明了 action-relevant structure 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。\n263\t    Median 档位下此结论被接受（支持 C1 \"image tokens 不 attend to instructions\" 的验证）， 但 reviewer\n264\t    可能指出：这只说明 image_mean RSA 不依赖 instruction，不能推广到 last_preaction tokens（C2 的核心 readout\n265\t    position）。实际上 last_preaction 的 routing 完全依赖 instruction（cross-instruction probe\n266\t    100%），两个 readout 位置的 independence pattern 不同——这本身是一个 finding，但需要在论文中明确区分。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t  tables:\n270\t  - title: Instruction Ablation Effect on RSA\n271\t    columns:\n272\t    - Condition\n273\t    - Peak RSA\n274\t    - Δ vs with-inst\n275\t    rows:\n276\t    - - Untrained + instruction\n277\t      - '0.485'\n278\t      - baseline\n279\t    - - Untrained − instruction\n280\t      - '0.480'\n281\t      - '-0.004'\n282\t    - - Threshold for significance\n283\t      - —\n284\t      - '0.10'\n285\t    - - DINO baseline\n286\t      - '0.388'\n287\t      - —\n288\t  figures_description:\n289\t  - 'Per-layer RSA curves: with-instruction vs without-instruction overlay，几乎完全重合。DINO\n290\t    horizontal line 远低于两者。'\n291\t  analysis: 'Reviewer 接受。此 negative result 实际强化了 C1：image tokens 的 action-relevant  geometry\n292\t    来自 visual content，instruction presence 不影响。但 median 档位下  Reviewer 2 会追问：\"if instruction\n293\t    doesn''t matter for image tokens, what exactly  does VLA training change?\" — 这个问题的答案在\n294\t    C2（routing at instruction token positions）， 但需要更清晰的 framing。\n295\t\n296\t    '\n297\t- name: 2×2 training × instruction matrix\n298\t  plan_id: plan_007\n299\t  description: 四条件全收敛验证 — trained/untrained × with/without instruction\n300\t  expected_results:\n301\t    trained_with_inst: 0.4876\n302\t    trained_no_inst: 0.489\n303\t    untrained_with_inst: 0.4846\n304\t    untrained_no_inst: 0.4802\n305\t    bootstrap_delta_ci: '[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0'\n306\t    max_pairwise_delta: 0.0088\n307\t    dino_baseline: 0.388\n308\t  result_rationale: \"2×2 matrix 所有 4 cells 收敛在 0.480-0.489 的窄带中，bootstrap CI 包含 0。\\\n309\t    \\ 这是 C3 \\\"instruction invariance\\\" observation 的定量基础。Median 档位下被接受 但 reviewer\\\n310\t    \\ 的解读分歧： - Reviewer 1：接受，认为 \\\"vision encoder geometry dominates\\\" 是 clean result\\\n311\t    \\ - Reviewer 2：认为这意味着 \\\"neither training nor instruction has meaningful effect\\\n312\t    \\ \\n  on image token geometry\\\"，进而质疑论文的 novelty——如果训练不改变 RSA，论文需要\\n  更强地论证 routing/R²\\\n313\t    \\ 变化的意义\\n- Reviewer 3：接受，但要求将此与 C2 的 exit collapse（R² 层面的变化）明确对比——\\n  RSA 不变但\\\n314\t    \\ R² 变化说明 \\\"geometry preserved but decodability reorganized\\\"\\n\"\n315\t  tables:\n316\t  - title: '2×2 Factorial Design: RSA Convergence'\n317\t    columns:\n318\t    - ''\n319\t    - With Instruction\n320\t    - Without Instruction\n321\t    - Instruction Effect\n322\t    rows:\n323\t    - - Trained\n324\t      - '0.488'\n325\t      - '0.489'\n326\t      - '-0.001'\n327\t    - - Untrained\n328\t      - '0.485'\n329\t      - '0.480'\n330\t      - '+0.004'\n331\t    - - Training Effect\n332\t      - '+0.003'\n333\t      - '+0.009'\n334\t      - —\n335\t  figures_description:\n336\t  - '2×2 interaction plot: RSA on y-axis (range 0.47-0.50), training on x-axis, instruction\n337\t    as separate lines。Lines nearly flat and overlapping — no main effects, no interaction。DINO\n338\t    at 0.388 shown as reference。'\n339\t  analysis: 'Median 档位的关键 pivot point。此实验的 \"null result\"（4 条件无差异）在 median  scenario\n340\t    下被部分 reviewer 视为 limitation：\"if your framework can''t detect training  effects\n341\t    in RSA, perhaps RSA is the wrong metric。\" 这直接导致 C3 从 core claim  降为 observation。Rebuttal\n342\t    需要论证：RSA invariance + R² divergence = geometry-function  dissociation，这本身是 interesting，但需要\n343\t    behavioral evidence 来确认 functional significance。\n344\t\n345\t    '\n346\t- name: Random instruction control (content invariance)\n347\t  plan_id: plan_008\n348\t  description: 用 random/shuffled/empty instruction 替代真实 instruction 测 RSA 变化\n349\t  expected_results:\n350\t    normal_peak_rsa: 0.4888\n351\t    random_peak_rsa: 0.4835\n352\t    shuffled_peak_rsa: 0.4832\n353\t    empty_peak_rsa: 0.4723\n354\t    max_absolute_delta: 0.0165\n355\t    instruction_invariant: true\n356\t  result_rationale: '三重不变性完备验证：training invariance（plan_007）+ instruction presence\n357\t    invariance （plan_006）+ instruction content invariance（此实验）。所有 delta < 0.017。 Median\n358\t    档位下被全部 reviewer 接受为 thorough control。这实际上强化了 C1 framework 的可信度——image token geometry\n359\t    对 instruction content 完全不敏感。 但 reviewer 会对比 counterfactual sensitivity results（C2-X\n360\t    CF）：image tokens 对 instruction invariant，但 instruction/last_preaction tokens 高度\n361\t    sensitive（d≥0.45）。 这个 dissociation 本身是 interesting，但在 median 档位下被认为 \"consistent\n362\t    with  causal mask — not surprising。\"\n363\t\n364\t    '\n365\t  tables:\n366\t  - title: Instruction Content Invariance (Trained Model)\n367\t    columns:\n368\t    - Instruction Type\n369\t    - Peak RSA\n370\t    - Δ vs Normal\n371\t    rows:\n372\t    - - Normal (correct)\n373\t      - '0.489'\n374\t      - baseline\n375\t    - - Random tokens\n376\t      - '0.484'\n377\t      - '-0.005'\n378\t    - - Shuffled words\n379\t      - '0.483'\n380\t      - '-0.006'\n381\t    - - Empty string\n382\t      - '0.472'\n383\t      - '-0.017'\n384\t  figures_description:\n385\t  - 'Per-layer RSA curves: 4 instruction conditions overlaid。All curves within ±0.017\n386\t    band。Peak layers identical (L16)。'\n387\t  analysis: 'Uncontroversial control。所有 reviewer 认为此实验 demonstrates thoroughness。\n388\t    Median 档位下唯一 minor concern：empty string Δ=-0.017 是 4 条件中最大的， 暗示 instruction presence\n389\t    有微弱效应（token count/position effect），但远低于 threshold。\n390\t\n391\t    '\n392\t- name: CKA verification (metric robustness)\n393\t  plan_id: plan_009\n394\t  description: 用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，确保不是指标依赖\n395\t  expected_results:\n396\t    linear_cka_ordering: untrained > trained > projector > DINO\n397\t    rdm_cka_ordering: trained > projector > untrained > DINO\n398\t    rsa_ordering: projector >> trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\n399\t    cka_reversal_detected: true\n400\t    dino_lowest_robust: true\n401\t    last_preaction_highest: 0.127\n402\t  result_rationale: '这是 median 档位的关键 problematic experiment。CKA ordering 与 RSA 反转——\n403\t    CKA 下 untrained > trained（RSA 下 trained ≈ untrained），projector 不再最高。 这直接导致： (1)\n404\t    C3 的 \"non-monotonic refinement\" 仅在 RSA 下成立，metric-dependent； (2) DINOv2 \"highest\n405\t    geometric foundation\" 仅在 RSA 下成立； (3) 1-2 位 reviewer 认为 RSA 结果不可推广。 但 DINO 在所有\n406\t    metrics 下均最低（robust），且 last_preaction >> image_mean 的 redistribution pattern 在\n407\t    CKA 下也成立。 A2 partially 的表现：exit collapse 主要基于 R²（functional metric），不依赖 RSA/CKA，\n408\t    所以 exit collapse 本身不受 CKA reversal 影响。但 C3 vision encoder geometry claim  被严重\n409\t    undercut。\n410\t\n411\t    '\n412\t  tables:\n413\t  - title: RSA vs CKA Metric Comparison\n414\t    columns:\n415\t    - Representation\n416\t    - RSA (ρ)\n417\t    - Linear CKA\n418\t    - RDM-CKA\n419\t    - Consistent?\n420\t    rows:\n421\t    - - SigLIP Projector\n422\t      - '0.615'\n423\t      - '0.081'\n424\t      - '0.257'\n425\t      - No — RSA >> CKA\n426\t    - - VLA Trained (img_mean)\n427\t      - '0.488'\n428\t      - '0.083'\n429\t      - '0.260'\n430\t      - 'No'\n431\t    - - VLA Untrained (img_mean)\n432\t      - '0.485'\n433\t      - '0.089'\n434\t      - '0.246'\n435\t      - No — CKA reversal\n436\t    - - DINO cls_token\n437\t      - '0.388'\n438\t      - '0.066'\n439\t      - '0.241'\n440\t      - Yes — lowest in all\n441\t    - - VLA Trained (last_pre)\n442\t      - —\n443\t      - '0.127'\n444\t      - '0.290'\n445\t      - Highest in CKA\n446\t  figures_description:\n447\t  - 'Side-by-side bar charts: RSA ordering (projector > trained ≈ untrained > DINO)\n448\t    vs CKA ordering (untrained > trained > projector > DINO for linear CKA)。Visual\n449\t    对比 highlights reversal。'\n450\t  analysis: 'Median 档位核心 attack surface。Reviewer 2 的典型评论： \"The RSA-CKA dissociation\n451\t    undermines confidence in the geometric interpretation.  The authors claim ''non-monotonic\n452\t    refinement'' based on RSA, but CKA shows monotonic  structure. This metric dependence\n453\t    should be acknowledged as a fundamental limitation,  not relegated to an appendix.\"\n454\t    Rebuttal 策略：承认 dissociation，将 C3 降为 \"observation under RSA\"，强调 C2 （exit collapse,\n455\t    routing）基于 R² functional probe，不依赖 RSA/CKA 选择。 Reviewer acceptance for C3 drops\n456\t    to ~0.4，但 C2 不受影响（~0.75）。\n457\t\n458\t    '\n459\t- name: LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark replication\n460\t  plan_id: plan_010\n461\t  description: 第三个 benchmark 交叉验证 RSA inverted-U 和 R² patterns\n462\t  expected_results:\n463\t    rsa_trained_img_peak:\n464\t      layer: 14\n465\t      rsa: 0.691\n466\t    rsa_trained_lastpre_peak:\n467\t      layer: 15\n468\t      rsa: 0.695\n469\t    rsa_untrained_img_peak:\n470\t      layer: 0\n471\t      rsa: 0.652\n472\t    r2_trained_img_peak:\n473\t      layer: 13\n474\t      R2: 0.696\n475\t    r2_trained_lastpre_peak:\n476\t      layer: 21\n477\t      R2: 0.675\n478\t    r2_untrained_img_peak:\n479\t      layer: 0\n480\t      R2: 0.673\n481\t    bootstrap_p: <0.001 for all trained vs untrained\n482\t    cross_benchmark_consistency: high — peak layers within 2-layer range\n483\t  result_rationale: 'LIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 patterns：trained inverted-U,  untrained\n484\t    flat/declining, bootstrap significant。Peak layers 一致（Goal L8-L13,  Spatial L13-L21）。Median\n485\t    档位下此实验强化了 within-OpenVLA 的 reproducibility， 被 reviewer 接受。但 reviewer 会注意到： (1)\n486\t    仍然是同一架构（OpenVLA），跨架构验证更重要（D088-D094 addresses this）； (2) RSA inverted-U 的 rise\n487\t    phase 在 Spatial 中 Δρ=0.039（Goal 中 0.016）， 略更 robust 但仍在 metric-dependent 的质疑范围内。\n488\t\n489\t    '\n490\t  tables:\n491\t  - title: Cross-Benchmark Replication (Goal vs Spatial)\n492\t    columns:\n493\t    - Metric\n494\t    - Goal Peak\n495\t    - Spatial Peak\n496\t    - Δ Layers\n497\t    rows:\n498\t    - - RSA trained img_mean\n499\t      - L12 (0.628)\n500\t      - L14 (0.691)\n501\t      - '+2'\n502\t    - - RSA trained last_pre\n503\t      - L12 (0.643)\n504\t      - L15 (0.695)\n505\t      - '+3'\n506\t    - - R² trained img_mean\n507\t      - L8 (0.655)\n508\t      - L13 (0.696)\n509\t      - '+5'\n510\t    - - R² trained last_pre\n511\t      - L13 (0.678)\n512\t      - L21 (0.675)\n513\t      - '+8'\n514\t  figures_description:\n515\t  - 'Dual-panel per-layer profile: Goal (left) vs Spatial (right), with RSA and R²\n516\t    curves overlaid。Both show inverted-U for trained condition。Peak layers marked\n517\t    with vertical lines。'\n518\t  analysis: 'Reviewer 接受 cross-benchmark replication。Median 档位下 Reviewer 1 可能评价： \"Good\n519\t    that patterns replicate across task suites, but both are within the same  model\n520\t    (OpenVLA). The cross-architecture validation (TracVLA, NORA) is more convincing  for\n521\t    the generalization claim.\" 此实验对 A1 holds 贡献但不是 decisive。\n522\t\n523\t    '\n524\t- name: Full-layer R² scan (132 probes)\n525\t  plan_id: plan_011\n526\t  description: 33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations — R² per-layer curve 验证 exit\n527\t    collapse\n528\t  expected_results:\n529\t    trained_image_mean_peak:\n530\t      layer: 8\n531\t      R2: 0.6553\n532\t    trained_last_preaction_peak:\n533\t      layer: 13\n534\t      R2: 0.6779\n535\t    untrained_image_mean_peak:\n536\t      layer: 0\n537\t      R2: 0.6403\n538\t    untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n539\t      layer: 32\n540\t      R2: 0.6093\n541\t    bootstrap_best_vs_best_imgmean:\n542\t      delta: 0.015\n543\t      p: 0.006\n544\t    bootstrap_best_vs_best_lastpre:\n545\t      delta: 0.069\n546\t      p: 0.0001\n547\t    untrained_L10_L13_collapse: R² near -0.33 (pathological)\n548\t  result_rationale: \"此实验是 C2 exit collapse 的 foundational evidence（OpenVLA 内部）。 Trained\\\n549\t    \\ last_preaction 显示经典 inverted-U：L13 peak 0.678 → L32 exit 0.609（Δ=0.069）。 Untrained\\\n550\t    \\ 则 L10-L13 完全 collapse（R² ≈ -0.33），仅 L32 恢复到 0.609。\\nMedian 档位下（A2 partially）：\\\n551\t    \\ - Exit collapse pattern 被接受（3/4 reviewers） - 但 Reviewer 3 质疑 Δ>0.10 阈值的 principled\\\n552\t    \\ justification：为什么不是 0.05 或 0.15？\\n  这个阈值是 ad hoc 还是有统计或领域基础？\\n- Rebuttal 需要补充\\\n553\t    \\ sensitivity analysis：在 0.05/0.10/0.15 三个阈值下 pattern 是否稳定\\n注意：OpenVLA 的 R² exit\\\n554\t    \\ Δ 在 v3 MCCV 修正后仅 0.033-0.086（VLA→VLA transition）， 低于 0.10 阈值。真正的 exit collapse\\\n555\t    \\ 来自 TracVLA/NORA（VLM→VLA transition, Δ=0.156-0.455）。 此实验建立了 baseline expectation，但\\\n556\t    \\ median 档位下 reviewer 会质疑 threshold choice。\\n\"\n557\t  tables:\n558\t  - title: R² Peak-Exit Comparison (OpenVLA, LIBERO-Goal)\n559\t    columns:\n560\t    - Condition\n561\t    - Peak Layer\n562\t    - Peak R²\n563\t    - Exit R²\n564\t    - Δ(peak-exit)\n565\t    rows:\n566\t    - - Trained img_mean\n567\t      - L8\n568\t      - '0.655'\n569\t      - '0.520'\n570\t      - '0.135'\n571\t    - - Trained last_pre\n572\t      - L13\n573\t      - '0.678'\n574\t      - '0.609'\n575\t      - '0.069'\n576\t    - - Untrained img_mean\n577\t      - L0\n578\t      - '0.640'\n579\t      - '0.584'\n580\t      - '0.056'\n581\t    - - Untrained last_pre\n582\t      - L32\n583\t      - '0.609'\n584\t      - '0.609'\n585\t      - '0.000'\n586\t  - title: Bootstrap Statistical Comparison\n587\t    columns:\n588\t    - Comparison\n589\t    - Δ R²\n590\t    - p-value\n591\t    - Significant?\n592\t    rows:\n593\t    - - Best-vs-best img_mean\n594\t      - '+0.015'\n595\t      - '0.006'\n596\t      - 'Yes'\n597\t    - - Best-vs-best last_pre\n598\t      - '+0.069'\n599\t      - <0.0001\n600\t      - 'Yes'\n601\t    - - Same-layer L8 img_mean\n602\t      - '+0.123'\n603\t      - <0.0001\n604\t      - 'Yes'\n605\t    - - Same-layer L13 last_pre\n606\t      - '+1.007'\n607\t      - <0.0001\n608\t      - Yes (collapsed)\n609\t  figures_description:\n610\t  - 'Per-layer R² profile: trained vs untrained, image_mean and last_preaction in\n611\t    separate panels。Trained shows inverted-U with gradual decline。Untrained shows\n612\t    deep-layer collapse (L10-L13 near zero) with L32 recovery spike。Shaded 95% CI\n613\t    bands from bootstrap。'\n614\t  analysis: 'Median 档位核心争议之一。Reviewer 3 的典型 comment： \"The Δ>0.10 threshold for ''substantial''\n615\t    exit collapse appears arbitrary. At this  threshold, OpenVLA shows collapse only\n616\t    for image_mean (Δ=0.135) but not last_preaction  (Δ=0.069). The authors should\n617\t    provide a principled justification or show that  conclusions hold across a range\n618\t    of thresholds.\"\n619\t\n620\t    Rebuttal strategy：补充 sensitivity analysis showing pattern stability at 0.05/0.10/0.15。\n621\t    At Δ>0.05：VLM→VLA 仍然 6/6，VLA→VLA 变为 2/4（Goal Δ=0.086 > 0.05）。 At Δ>0.15：VLM→VLA\n622\t    仍然 5/6（TracVLA Spatial Δ=0.138 borderline）。 二元分离（VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA）在所有阈值下基本 stable。\n623\t\n624\t    '\n625\t- name: CLIP-ViT pretraining control\n626\t  plan_id: plan_012\n627\t  description: CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder quality\n628\t  expected_results:\n629\t    projector_R2: 0.6298\n630\t    dino_cls_R2: 0.6343\n631\t    clip_cls_R2: 0.5866\n632\t    vla_image_mean_L19_R2: 0.5986\n633\t    vla_last_preaction_L19_R2: 0.6711\n634\t    ordering: last_pre > dino_cls ≈ projector > vla_img_mean > clip_cls\n635\t    clip_vs_dino_p: 0.0\n636\t  result_rationale: \"CLIP < DINO 在 RSA 和 R² 下均成立，否定了 \\\"VL pretraining dominance\\\"\\\n637\t    \\ hypothesis。 Self-supervised (DINOv2) 比 VL pretrained (CLIP) 更好地 capture action-relevant\\\n638\t    \\ structure。 Median 档位下此结果被接受，但 Reviewer 1 可能质疑： (1) CLIP ViT-L 和 DINOv2 ViT-L\\\n639\t    \\ 是不同的 architecture variants，不能 solely \\n    attribute to pretraining difference；\\n\\\n640\t    (2) SigLIP（OpenVLA 的实际 encoder）是 VL pretrained 但 RSA=0.615 > DINO=0.631，\\n   \\\n641\t    \\ 矛盾——但这通过 plan_013 branch split 解释（fused backbone 中 DINOv2 和 SigLIP \\n    贡献\\\n642\t    \\ equally）。\\n\"\n643\t  tables:\n644\t  - title: Cross-Encoder Action Probe R² (Unified Hyperparams)\n645\t    columns:\n646\t    - Encoder\n647\t    - Pretraining\n648\t    - R²\n649\t    - vs Projector p\n650\t    rows:\n651\t    - - VLA last_pre L19\n652\t      - VLA fine-tuned\n653\t      - '0.671'\n654\t      - '0.002'\n655\t    - - DINO cls_token\n656\t      - Self-supervised\n657\t      - '0.634'\n658\t      - 0.557 (n.s.)\n659\t    - - SigLIP+Projector\n660\t      - VL + projection\n661\t      - '0.630'\n662\t      - baseline\n663\t    - - VLA img_mean L19\n664\t      - VLA fine-tuned\n665\t      - '0.599'\n666\t      - <0.001\n667\t    - - CLIP cls_token\n668\t      - VL contrastive\n669\t      - '0.587'\n670\t      - <0.001\n671\t  figures_description:\n672\t  - 'Bar chart with 95% CI: R² for 5 representations。DINO ≈ Projector > CLIP clearly。last_preaction\n673\t    highest。'\n674\t  analysis: 'Clean result，全部 reviewer 接受。Median 档位下此实验的贡献是 \"supporting evidence  for\n675\t    C3 vision encoder geometry observation\"——DINOv2 ranking under RSA 在 functional  probe\n676\t    中也 partially replicated（DINO R² ≈ Projector R²）。但 CKA reversal（plan_009） 仍然 undermines\n677\t    跨 metric generalizability。\n678\t\n679\t    '\n680\t- name: Branch-split RSA (DINOv2 vs SigLIP in fused backbone)\n681\t  plan_id: plan_013\n682\t  description: 分离 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中 DINOv2 branch vs SigLIP branch 的 RSA\n683\t    贡献\n684\t  expected_results:\n685\t    dinov2_branch_rsa: 0.619\n686\t    siglip_branch_rsa: 0.621\n687\t    fused_2176d_rsa: 0.634\n688\t    post_projector_4096d_rsa: 0.615\n689\t    standalone_dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n690\t    standalone_dino_patch_mean_rsa: 0.631\n691\t  result_rationale: \"DINOv2 ≈ SigLIP（Δ < 0.002）在 fused backbone 中贡献 equally。 Fused\\\n692\t    \\ > either branch（complementary benefit）。Projector 从 0.634 压缩到 0.615。 Median 档位下此实验被接受为\\\n693\t    \\ clean decomposition： - Reviewer 接受 \\\"both branches contribute equally\\\" 的结论\\\n694\t    \\ - 但注意到 standalone DINO cls (0.692) > in-backbone DINOv2 branch (0.619)，\\n  差距可能来自\\\n695\t    \\ extraction layer difference（standalone = last layer，\\n  in-backbone = fused\\\n696\t    \\ intermediate）——这不是 meaningful comparison\\n- 此实验支持 C3 但 C3 已降为 observation，所以贡献有限\\n\"\n697\t  tables:\n698\t  - title: Fused Backbone Branch Decomposition\n699\t    columns:\n700\t    - Component\n701\t    - RSA (ρ)\n702\t    - Dim\n703\t    - Note\n704\t    rows:\n705\t    - - DINOv2 branch\n706\t      - '0.619'\n707\t      - '1088'\n708\t      - in-backbone\n709\t    - - SigLIP branch\n710\t      - '0.621'\n711\t      - '1088'\n712\t      - in-backbone\n713\t    - - Fused backbone\n714\t      - '0.634'\n715\t      - '2176'\n716\t      - before projection\n717\t    - - Post-projector\n718\t      - '0.615'\n719\t      - '4096'\n720\t      - LLM input\n721\t    - - Standalone DINO cls\n722\t      - '0.692'\n723\t      - '1024'\n724\t      - different layer\n725\t  figures_description:\n726\t  - 'Stacked decomposition diagram: DINOv2 (0.619) + SigLIP (0.621) → Fused (0.634)\n727\t    → Projector (0.615)。Arrows show fusion gain (+0.013) and projection loss (-0.019)。'\n728\t  analysis: Median 档位下所有 reviewer 接受。此实验的价值在 median scenario 下有限—— C3 已降为 observation，branch-split\n729\t    的精细分解不会改变 reviewer 对 core claims 的评估。 但它 demonstrates thoroughness，可能为 reviewer\n730\t    1 的正面评价贡献 \"well-executed experimental design\"。 Reviewer 3 可能在 minor comments 中建议\n731\t    \"move branch-split analysis to supplementary  to save main text space for the\n732\t    cross-architecture results which are more impactful。\"\n733\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LgJQjdAbFKM8Sgf8v3eXT3","session_id":"a551ef02-7e02-4516-a695-4e220ef1b867","uuid":"4feeba49-6467-4bf0-a798-060da73d635d","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:35:23.418Z"}
